WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:05.812
The Six to Ten of Cups move from memory and
daydreams to contentment and belonging.

00:00:05.812 --> 00:00:08.479
Each card has an upright and a reversed
meaning.

00:00:09.779 --> 00:00:10.485
Six of Cups.

00:00:10.485 --> 00:00:12.309
Nostalgia, innocence, kindness.

00:00:12.309 --> 00:00:15.781
Two children in a courtyard share cups
filled with flowers.

00:00:17.081 --> 00:00:18.027
Seven of Cups.

00:00:18.027 --> 00:00:20.191
Options, imagination, daydreams.

00:00:20.191 --> 00:00:28.912
A silhouetted figure faces a cloud holding seven cups, each containing
something different, such as a castle, jewels or a dragon.

00:00:30.312 --> 00:00:32.639
Have a tarot spread in front of you?

00:00:32.639 --> 00:00:37.359
Photograph it at readmyspread.com, and get
a clear reading, card by card.
